OWNERS' ASSEMBLY CALL
Rose Court
2026 ordinary assembly
Dear owner,
The Rose Court owners' assembly of ordinary will be held on 18 Jan 2026 10:00 at Site toplantı salonu.
If there is no quorum at the first meeting, the second meeting is held on 28 Jan 2026 10:00 at the same place.

Agenda
  1. Açılış ve başkanlık divanı seçimi
  2. 2026 bütçesinin onaylanması (to be voted)
     Aidatın 2.000 TL olarak belirlenmesi
  3. Yönetici ve denetçi seçimi (to be voted)

You may attend yourself or through a proxy; hand in the proxy letter at the entrance.

Prepared by OpenBekci on 20 Dec 2025 09:00.
